`verilator_config
// All RTL is linted with -Wall. No third-party code is part of the design.
//
// Reset synchronizers (rst_sync -> tech_sync): the last stage of the chain is
// the synchronized reset (used asynchronously by the flops it resets) and the
// earlier stages feed it as data. Verilator reports the stage array as one
// signal used both ways; this is the intended async-assert/sync-release
// structure. Waived for the stage array of the synchronizer cell only.
lint_off -rule SYNCASYNCNET -file "*rtl/tech/tech_sync.sv" -match "*stage_q*"
